#. 6.0->settings-schema.json->windows-rounded-corners-sync->description
msgid "Match the corner radius set by the \"Rounded Corners\" extension"
msgstr ""

#. 6.0->settings-schema.json->windows-rounded-corners-sync->tooltip
msgid ""
"When enabled, windows rounded by the \"Rounded Corners\" extension will use "
"that extension's corner radius for their Blur Cinnamon effects instead of "
"the corner settings in the table above. Windows, or the top/bottom corners "
"of a window, that \"Rounded Corners\" is not rounding (e.g. maximized "
"windows) still use the table settings. This option will have no effect "
"unless the \"Rounded Corners\" extension is installed and active."
msgstr ""
